    Fonts: '‮Fonts‬',
    'Four bags each at a board with a hole near the top. In the hole is three, on the board is one, and a bag landing on another shoves it. Only the difference between the two rounds counts.':
      '‮Four‬ ‮bags‬ ‮each‬ ‮at‬ ‮a‬ ‮board‬ ‮with‬ ‮a‬ ‮hole‬ ‮near‬ ‮the‬ ‮top.‬ ‮In‬ ‮the‬ ‮hole‬ ‮is‬ ‮three,‬ ‮on‬ ‮the‬ ‮board‬ ‮is‬ ‮one,‬ ‮and‬ ‮a‬ ‮bag‬ ‮landing‬ ‮on‬ ‮another‬ ‮shoves‬ ‮it.‬ ‮Only‬ ‮the‬ ‮difference‬ ‮between‬ ‮the‬ ‮two‬ ‮rounds‬ ‮counts.‬',
