    "Problems and suggestions are welcome through the project's issue tracker, which is where all of the work on DuelBox happens in the open.":
      "‮Problems‬ ‮and‬ ‮suggestions‬ ‮are‬ ‮welcome‬ ‮through‬ ‮the‬ ‮project's‬ ‮issue‬ ‮tracker,‬ ‮which‬ ‮is‬ ‮where‬ ‮all‬ ‮of‬ ‮the‬ ‮work‬ ‮on‬ ‮DuelBox‬ ‮happens‬ ‮in‬ ‮the‬ ‮open.‬",
    'Pull back from the ball and let go — further back is a harder shot':
      '‮Pull‬ ‮back‬ ‮from‬ ‮the‬ ‮ball‬ ‮and‬ ‮let‬ ‮go‬ ‮—‬ ‮further‬ ‮back‬ ‮is‬ ‮a‬ ‮harder‬ ‮shot‬',
